sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Clin as Prescriber
    participant Rx as PharmacyService
    participant Inv as InventoryService
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Audit as AuditService

    Clin->>Rx: Create Prescription (patientId, encounterId, items)
    Rx->>DB: Create Prescription + PrescriptionItems
    Rx->>Audit: audit prescription.created
    Rx-->>Clin: Prescription issued
    participant Pharm as Pharmacist
    Pharm->>Inv: Check stock (batches)
    Inv->>DB: Find StockBatch by medication/branch (FEFO order)
    Inv->>Inv: allocateFefo(requested)
    Pharm->>Rx: Dispense
    Rx->>Inv: Deduct stock via InventoryLedgerEntry
    Inv->>DB: Create InventoryLedgerEntry (append-only)
    Rx->>DB: Update Prescription status (DISPENSED/PARTIALLY_DISPENSED)
    Rx->>Audit: audit prescription.dispensed
    Note over Inv: FEFO allocation in service; ledger append-only (trigger)
    Note over Inv: Movements recorded immutably
